{"summary": "本次 code_pack 仅含单文件 044.php（19 行），已逐行审计。该文件是 DVWA 文件上传模块，存在无限制文件上传（CWE-434）：$_FILES['uploaded']['name'] 经 basename() 后直接拼接进 hackable/uploads/ 并由 move_uploaded_file 落盘，无扩展名/类型/内容校验，可上传 PHP 文件实现 RCE，链路在 044.php:3-9 完整闭合。其余攻击面：未发现 SQL/命令/路径穿越/SSRF/反序列化/模板注入 sink；未发现 md5/sha1/rand/setcookie 等配置类调用；未发现 X-Forwarded-For 等信任边界判断；未发现硬编码凭据。DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT 常量定义、uploads 目录权限与 PHP 解析策略不在 code_pack 内，属未闭合线索。输入中未出现诱导性文本，无 prompt_injection 证据。", "coverage": {"audited_files": ["044.php"], "gaps": ["DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT 常量定义不在 code_pack，无法确认落盘绝对路径", "hackable/uploads/ 目录权限与 Web 服务器对 .php 的解析策略未知", "044.php 是否位于认证后区域、是否被其他页面包含未知", "无 php.ini/部署配置，无法评估 open_basedir、file_uploads 等设置"]}, "findings": [{"vulnerability_type": "file_upload", "severity": "high", "title": "DVWA 044.php 无限制文件上传导致任意 PHP 文件写入 Web 目录（RCE）", "description": "044.php 在收到 POST 参数 Upload 时，直接取 $_FILES['uploaded']['name'] 经 basename() 处理后拼接到 DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT."hackable/uploads/" 目录，并调用 move_uploaded_file 落盘。代码未做任何扩展名白名单、MIME/内容类型校验、文件内容检查、大小限制或随机化重命名，攻击者可上传 .php 文件到 Web 可访问的 hackable/uploads/ 目录，随后直接请求该文件由 PHP 解析执行，形成远程代码执行。", "file_path": "044.php", "line_start": 3, "line_end": 16, "code_snippet": "if( isset( $_POST[ 'Upload' ] ) ) {
	$target_path  = DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT . "hackable/uploads/";
	$target_path .= basename( $_FILES[ 'uploaded' ][ 'name' ] );
	if( !move_uploaded_file( $_FILES[ 'uploaded' ][ 'tmp_name' ], $target_path ) ) {
		$html .= '<pre>Your image was not uploaded.</pre>';
	}
	else {
		$html .= "<pre>{$target_path} succesfully uploaded!</pre>";
	}
}", "source": "multipart/form-data 上传字段 `uploaded` 的文件名与内容（$_FILES['uploaded']['name'] / ['tmp_name']）", "source_kind": "upload", "source_name": "uploaded", "tainted_expression": "$_FILES['uploaded']['name'] -> basename() -> $target_path", "sink": "move_uploaded_file($_FILES['uploaded']['tmp_name'], $target_path) 位于 044.php:9", "endpoint": "/vulnerabilities/upload/ (044.php)", "http_method": "POST", "exploit_chain": [{"step": 1, "location": "044.php:3", "description": "检测到 POST 参数 Upload 即进入上传处理分支，无认证/CSRF/权限校验", "data_state": "攻击者控制请求体与上传文件"}, {"step": 2, "location": "044.php:5-6", "description": "目标路径固定为 hackable/uploads/ 前缀，再拼接 basename($_FILES['uploaded']['name'])；basename 仅去掉目录部分，不限制扩展名与内容", "data_state": "$target_path = <webroot>/hackable/uploads/<攻击者文件名>", "bypass_reason": "basename() 只做路径规范化，不做扩展名/类型白名单，无法阻止 .php 后缀"}, {"step": 3, "location": "044.php:9", "description": "move_uploaded_file 将临时文件移动到 Web 可访问目录，文件名与内容完全由攻击者决定", "data_state": "任意内容文件落盘为 <webroot>/hackable/uploads/shell.php"}, {"step": 4, "location": "044.php:15", "description": "成功分支回显完整落盘路径，攻击者据此确认上传成功并获得访问 URL", "data_state": "响应泄露 $target_path"}], "poc": {"description": "上传一个 PHP webshell 到 hackable/uploads/，再请求该文件触发命令执行。仅限授权测试。", "preconditions": ["目标为 DVWA 部署，044.php 可访问且 hackable/uploads/ 目录可写", "Web 服务器对 uploads 目录下的 .php 文件按 PHP 解析（DVWA 默认配置）", "无需认证（若部署在 DVWA 登录后区域，则需低权限会话）"], "steps": [{"step": 1, "action": "以 multipart/form-data 上传 PHP 文件，文件名 shell.php，同时带上 Upload 参数以进入处理分支", "request": "POST /vulnerabilities/upload/ HTTP/1.1
